            </figure>
          ))}
        </div>
      </Wrapper>
    </section>

    <section class="section-block status-section" aria-labelledby="status-heading">
      <Wrapper variant="standard">
        <div class="status-panel">
          <div class="section-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">Current status</p>
            <h2 id="status-heading">It works now. I am not done with it.</h2>
            <p>
              StyleFusion is a working authenticated HobFarm application. Projects, references, packs, exact prompts, and generations stay together, so a useful visual idea can be rebuilt, inspected, downloaded, or sent to another image model without starting over.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              I keep testing how schema and JSON decisions survive image models, video tools, provider translation, moderation, and “safety” layers that may reinterpret the same direction. StyleFusion is a content system and a research instrument. I will document the useful failures, fixes, and model behavior in Workshop Notes as the system keeps changing.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="status-actions">
            <Button isLink size="lg" variant="green" href={appUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Open StyleFusion
            </Button>
            <a href="/workshop/workshop-notes/">Read Workshop Notes →</a>
            <a href="#faq">Read the FAQ ↓</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Wrapper>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="section-block pt-0" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
      <Wrapper variant="standard">
